<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld sets 50 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Megaworld sets 50 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Megaworld Properties and Holdings Inc said on Wednesday its board had approved a 50 percent stock dividend to shareholders on record May 28.</p>
<p>The stock dividend declaration was approved by the board in its meeting on Tuesday, Megaworld said in a statement.</p>
<p>The payment is to be approved by stockholders at their annual meeting scheduled for May 9.</p>
</text>
